    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "gmnotes": "",
      "short": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>You engulf an area in a comet-like spiral of energy, untethering the souls or animating vital essence from undead in the area. Each undead creature in the area takes 10d8 damage and is @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.conditions.Item.aAQ6SW6iK0EVq8Ce]{Staggered} for 1 round. A creature that succeeds at a Will saving throw takes half damage and ignores the @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.conditions.Item.aAQ6SW6iK0EVq8Ce]{Staggered} effect. Mindless undead receive no saving throw. This spell has no effect on creatures that are not undead.</p>"
    },
